==Battleground==
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 8~13.33 seconds<sup>240f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 2~5.33 seconds<sup>60f~160f</sup>.
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 8~14 seconds<sup>240f~420f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**9 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage should be fairly easy, the 200% King's Mimic isn't a problem due to its low damage and only having 200,000 HP, though he can be a nuisance, so bringing a unit that can take him out fast is recommended. There are also Zombies in this stage, which a few anti-Zombie Cats could easily deal with due to them having a low magnification.

